# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-party software that MAY NOT be redistributed.
#
# CYANA 2.1  — commercial licence (Peter Güntert). Licence §4 forbids disclosing
#              the software to third parties.
# Xplor-NIH  — free for non-profit institutions, but README-LICENSE likewise
#              forbids disclosing the software or documentation to third parties.
#
# Both must be obtained by each user under their own licence and dropped into
# third_party/ locally. See docs/THIRD-PARTY.md.
#
# Never remove these rules. If you ever need to check that nothing leaked, run
#   tools/check-third-party.sh --audit
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
third_party/cyana-2.1/*
!third_party/cyana-2.1/.gitkeep
third_party/xplor-nih-2.39/*
!third_party/xplor-nih-2.39/.gitkeep

# Run artefacts
work/
out/
out-*/
*.pdb
*_energy.txt
*.runlog

# …except the committed reference results. The energy file carries Etotal,
# which is the figure a reader compares against, so it has to be tracked too.
!examples/reference/*.pdb
!examples/reference/*_energy.txt

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
